  "summary": "The design files contain multiple anomalies, most critically the MCU VDD pins are unconnected and the NAVC VSS pins are not tied to ground, which would leave both microcontrollers unpowered and non-functional. Additionally, the PCA9685 PWM driver is strapped to I2C address 0x41 instead of the specified 0x40."
